      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the identity_client.py file with local configuration and client helper utilities for Federated Login Flow, I need to include code that sets up a client for interacting with an identity provider. I will use the Auth0 Python SDK for this purpose, as it is a well-known identity provider with a robust Python SDK. The code will include importing the necessary modules, setting up the configuration, and defining a client helper function. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
