      "time_updated": 1789860623215
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement a PKCE login flow for public clients using a concrete external provider, I will choose Auth0 as the provider. Auth0 is a popular authentication platform that supports PKCE (Proof Key for Code Exchange) for public clients. I will write the Python code to interact with Auth0's API for the PKCE login flow. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860627627,
          "start": 1789860623216
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc01b370001QmeNNcewtpIYQJ",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc01aea1001rjsdiHAZVUybet",
      "session_id": "ses_f43fe516fffeFZuwI86WQqc1O3",
      "time_created": 1789860623216,
      "time_updated": 1789860627628
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_mUPmzB5v0tuBWxrjmBXBGJ",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import requests\nimport base64\nimport uuid\nimport json\n\n# Auth0 configuration\nAUTH0_DOMAIN = 'your-auth0-domain'\nCLIENT_ID = 'your-client-id'\nREDIRECT_URI = 'your-redirect-uri'\n\n# Step 1: Generate a code verifier and code challenge\ncode_verifier = base64.urlsafe_b64encode(uuid.uuid4().bytes).decode('utf-8')\ncode_challenge = base64.urlsafe_b64encode(\n    base64.urlsafe_b64decode(code_verifier)\n).decode('utf-8')\n\n# Step 2: Redirect the user to the Auth0 authorization endpoint\nauthorization_endpoint = f'https://{AUTH0_DOMAIN}/authorize'\nauthorization_params = {\n    'response_type': 'code',\n    'client_id': CLIENT_ID,\n    'redirect_uri': REDIRECT_URI,\n    'code_challenge': code_challenge,\n    'code_challenge_method': 'S256',\n}\n\n# Step 3: Handle the redirect and exchange the authorization code for tokens\ndef exchange_code_for_tokens(authorization_code):\n    token_endpoint = f'https://{AUTH0_DOMAIN}/oauth/token'\n    token_params = {\n        'grant_type': 'authorization_code',\n        'client_id': CLIENT_ID,\n        'code': authorization_code,\n        'redirect_uri': REDIRECT_URI,\n        'code_verifier': code_verifier,\n    }\n    response = requests.post(token_endpoint, data=token_params)\n    response.raise_for_status()\n    return response.json()\n\n# Example usage\n# authorization_code = 'your-authorization-code'\n# tokens = exchange_code_for_tokens(authorization_code)\n# print(tokens)",
